  "description": "My first love, whom I thought was dead, has returned. \n\nCurtis, who was killed when his entire family was wiped out by my father’s scheme, now stands before me, seeking revenge. \n\n*“Go ahead and beg, Roxana. Who knows? Maybe if you flirt with me using that pretty face of yours, I’ll spare your life.”*\n\nHe teased my neck with the blood-soaked tip of his sword, spewing out his icy sarcasm. \n\n *'My father’s sins have finally come to kill me.'*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
